[ti:Khaksar Diya]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:10.58]Log kahte hain... log kahte hain...
[00:13.16]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[00:18.31]Wo kahte hain diya hawa ke saamne kyun jalaye
[00:20.89]Ye to bujh jayega... ye to mit jayega... ye to khaak mein mil jayega
[00:26.05]Kya kahoon
[00:31.20]Jalna hi jalna hai
[00:33.78]Bujhna to andhera hai
[00:36.36]Jalna hi paana hai
[00:41.51]Magar ye jalna bhi kisi ki den hai
[00:44.09]Aur den ko jalna kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[00:46.67]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:49.25]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[00:54.40]Poochhte hain zakhm kyun nahi bhartaa
[00:56.98]Kyun hardam rota rehta hai
[01:02.14]Kya kahoon
[01:07.29]Hai bhoolna
[01:09.87]Hai maut
[01:12.45]Hai jeena
[01:17.60]Zakhm bharna hi bhoolna hai
[01:20.18]Bhoolna hi maut hai
[01:22.76]Zakhm jeena hai
[01:27.92]Har zakhm teri yaad ka kinaara hai
[01:30.49]Zakhm bhi kisko milte hain
[01:33.07]Ye bhi kisi ki aankhon ka upahaar hai
[01:38.23]Aur upahaar ko zakhm kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[01:40.81]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[01:43.38]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon — uski khayal mein hona bhi taqdeer ki baat hai
[01:48.54]Wo kahte hain tune apna ghar kyun ujada
[01:51.12]Apna naam kyun mitaya
[01:56.27]Kya kahoon
[02:01.43]Hai ujadna
[02:04.01]Hai mitna
[02:06.59]Hai rehna
[02:11.74]Ujadna bhi agar uski raza se ho
[02:14.32]To wo ghar nahi
[02:16.90]Haram hai
[02:22.05]Barbaadi ko barbaadi mat samjho
[02:24.63]Ye to us rang ki shuruaat hai
[02:27.21]Jahan pahunchne ke baad
[02:29.79]Koi lautna nahi chahta
[02:34.94]Aur is rang ko barbaadi kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[02:37.52]Log kahte hain... tere hone se...
[02:40.10]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai...
[02:42.68]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[02:45.25]Uski khayal mein hona bhi...
[02:50.41]Taqdeer ki baat hai
[02:58.14]Jogi ban ke aaya tha
[03:03.30]Preetam ne rang diya
[03:08.46]Barbaadi mein goonge jaisa har koi
[03:13.61]Par ye goongapan bhi to usi ki den hai
[03:21.35]Hai chuppi
[03:23.92]Hai bolna
[03:26.50]Hai milan
[03:31.66]Bolna kya cheez hai
[03:36.81]Uska naam lena bhi milan hai
[03:41.97]Aur milan se pehle khayal aana
[03:47.13]Wo to bas ek jhalak hai
[03:54.86]Hai jhalak
[03:57.44]Hai taqdeer
[04:00.01]Hai justaju
[04:05.17]Par ye jhalak bhi kise milti hai
[04:10.33]Wo bhi kisi ki taqdeer ki baat hai
[04:18.06]Aur is jhalak ko milan kehna — ye bhi parwaane ki hai justaju
[04:23.22]Log kahte hain...
[04:28.37]Tere hone se...
[04:33.53]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai...
[04:38.68]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[04:43.84]Uski khayal mein hona bhi...
[04:49.00]Taqdeer ki baat hai
[04:56.73]Hey Maula...
[05:01.89]Jo parwana ho
[05:07.04]Use ye samjha
[05:14.78]Hai jalna
[05:17.35]Hai den
[05:19.93]Hai justaju
[05:25.09]Ki jalna hi uski justaju thi
[05:30.24]Aur justaju hi uski ibaadat hai
[05:37.98]Ameen...
[05:45.71]Ameen...
[05:53.44]Ameen...
